{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Lootworld</strong> is an online <strong>extraction</strong> game designed to throw you into a high-risk, high-reward adventure. Enter the dungeon, fight off <strong>monsters and enemy players</strong>, and extract with <strong>rare loot</strong>\u2014if you survive. Work together with friends or go solo, but watch your back\u2014others are hunting for the same treasures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Survival isn\u2019t just about fighting\u2014it\u2019s about strategy, <strong>quick decision-making</strong>, and <strong>securing your loot</strong>. Each run is unique, with <strong>procedural dungeons</strong> hiding powerful weapons and <strong>game-changing gear</strong>. Make it to the exit portal, store your valuables in the <strong>Vault</strong>, and prepare for your next deadly run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597720/extras/chickey.png?t=1743193118\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features:</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Proximity Voice Chat:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Press V to meet and strategize with other players, or engage in some friendly trash talk.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597720/extras/slime.png?t=1743193118\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Challenging Procedural Dungeons:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face <strong>monsters and rival players</strong> as you explore dynamic dungeons, filled with <strong>hidden loot and danger</strong> at every turn.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Resource Management and Vault System:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Extract with <strong>valuable treasures</strong> and store them safely in your <strong>Vault</strong> to upgrade your gear.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597720/extras/sword.png?t=1743193118\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Fight for Survival:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stab, slash, and blast your way through PvPvE battles where only the strongest make it out alive.<br><br>The dungeon awaits. <strong>Enter, loot, and escape\u2014before someone else does.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597720/extras/slimeBottom.png?t=1743193118\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3597720?t=1743193118","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3597720?t=1743193118","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597720/3f8750d0b5f467669ec05a8604688a6de157a355/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743193118","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597720/3f8750d0b5f467669ec05a8604688a6de157a355/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743193118","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Lootworld</strong> is an online <strong>extraction</strong> game designed to throw you into a high-risk, high-reward adventure. Enter the dungeon, fight off <strong>monsters and enemy players</strong>, and extract with <strong>rare loot</strong>\u2014if you survive. Work together with friends or go solo, but watch your back\u2014others are hunting for the same treasures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Survival isn\u2019t just about fighting\u2014it\u2019s about strategy, <strong>quick decision-making